        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Survive endless waves of darkness as a divine warrior blessed with holy powers. Level up, unlock devastating spells, and face increasingly powerful demonic hordes. Will you ascend to face the ultimate evil?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ Three Distinct Game Modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  • Survival Mode - Test your skills in endless waves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  • Progression Mode - Journey through 5 increasingly difficult tiers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  • Ascended Mode - Face the ultimate challenge after completing Progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Dynamic Spell System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  • Holy Strike - Divine projectile that pierces through enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  • Divine Shield - Protective barrier with devastating counterattack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  • Metatron's Pulse - Screen-clearing holy explosion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 20+ Steam Achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  • Track your progress with diverse challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  • Unlock achievements for kills, bosses, survival time, and special conditions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📊 Steam Leaderboards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  • Compete globally in Survival and Progression modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  • Compare scores with friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  • Climb the ranks to prove your divine might</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💾 Steam Cloud Saves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  • Your progress syncs across devices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  • Meta-progression in Progression Mode keeps your stats on death</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  • Never lose your hard-earned upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Roguelike Progressio